# Long paddle: Broken Trace on LPAD_CK from U32 pin 1 to U28 CKA; CKA floats high, the left paddle
# counter stays at 0, LDONE is never set: the paddle runs down to the next trigger, and every
# hit reads paddle line 0 (steep up).
machine tennis
title "Long paddle"
brief "The left paddle reaches all the way down to the bottom wall, and every ball it returns flies off steeply upwards."
fault crack U32.1Y U28.CKA 50%
